</chakra.div>
```
The link element is **not** `ZimmLink` — it is a local `chakra(RouteLink)` wrap (`index.tsx:24`):
```ts
const SeeAllLink = chakra(RouteLink);
```
Driven by `seeAllHref` + `seeAllLabel` (both must be truthy). Styling lives in the `seeAllLink` recipe part (`css.ts:271-294`: `display: 'inline-block'`, `flexShrink: 0`, link colour tokens, `_hover`, `_focusVisible`).

**Carousel / slide-indicator / arrow primitives at rail level: none.** Explicitly ruled out at `index.tsx:78-81`: "No rail-level arrow buttons — `ZimmProductCardMedia` already carries its own intra-card carousel arrows". Recipe parts are only `['container', 'header', 'seeAllLink', 'group', 'card']` (`css.ts:226`).

